1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,000
OxyProof: a real, evidence-grounded research
workflow.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:11,500
Select the published Huang source group.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Choose source rows 1, 2 and 3.

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Set the interval to 700-1000 K.

5
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:34,000
Click Analyze. The backend calculates the curves.

6
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:40,000
Published fits, explicit units and evidence
limits.

7
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:46,000
700 K: source-row order 1 > 2 > 3.

8
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:55,000
Drag the actual slider; ordering changes with
temperature.

9
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:07,000
1000 K: source-row order 3 > 2 > 1.

10
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:14,500
Return to 700 K for a direct comparison.

11
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:24,500
Inspect the analytical crossing near 776 K.

12
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Then inspect the model crossings near 818 K and
854 K.

13
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:34,800
Calculated fits, not measured crossovers. No
uncertainty bounds.

14
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:42,700
Open Research Agent and its recorded DeepSeek
evidence.

15
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:49,800
Load saved genuine API traces. No new inference.

16
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:57,500
Replay B: DeepSeek selected
analyze_temperature_interval.

17
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:06,500
Inspect validated arguments and the local
scientific result.

18
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:14,800
Independent auditing controls the scientific
conclusion.

19
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:22,500
Replay C: 600 C, 10% humidity and 10,000 operating
hours.

20
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:29,300
The model proposed screening; the independent
guard checks the requirements.

21
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:37,000
No scientific tool executed. No candidates
recommended.

22
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:44,700
INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE: OxyProof abstains.

23
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:54,500
Return to the source rows, DOI and published fit
parameters.

24
00:02:56,500 --> 00:03:01,800
Click Export JSON to download the actual decision
report.

25
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:09,500
Inspect a byte-identical local copy of the
downloaded JSON.
